  "releaseNotes": "Breaking changes:\n- ColorExtensions: IsWhiteColor renamed to IsWhite\n- ColorExtensions: ToHexColor renamed to HexColor\n- ColorExtensions: TextColor return type changed from string? to string\n- ColorExtensions: Default color for unrecognized names changed from #000000 to #FFFFFF\n- ObjectExtensions: IfNotEqualsThrow signature changed to (T other, string parameterName, string? message)\n- StringExtensions: EqualsCaseInsensitive now returns true when both values are null\n\nImprovements:\n- ColorExtensions: HexColor and IsWhite are now case-insensitive for color names\n- StringExtensions: WithHtmlRemoved now correctly produces single space for nbsp\n\nNew features:\n- StringExtensions: OrDefault, OrException, UntilOrEmpty, EqualsCaseInsensitive\n- BoolExtensions: IfTrueThrows\n- ObjectExtensions: HasValue, HasValueExcept, ValueOrException, IfNotEqualsThrow\n- ListExtensions: TryGetFirstValue",
